n pose-mcp/internal/cli/quickstart_script_test.go\n    governed tracked path has no spec provenance claim\n    fix: backfill an explicit claim or add an exact reviewed exclusion\n[!] warning orphan pose-mcp/internal/pose/governance_operation_performance_test.go\n    governed tracked path has no spec provenance claim\n    fix: backfill an explicit claim or add an exact reviewed exclusion\n[!] warning orphan pose-mcp/internal/cli/help_catalog.go\n    governed tracked path has no spec provenance claim\n    fix: backfill an explicit claim or add an exact reviewed exclusion\n[!] warning orphan pose-mcp/internal/pose/review_reuse_provenance.go\n    governed tracked path has no spec provenance claim\n    fix: backfill an explicit claim or add an exact reviewed exclusion\n[!] warning orphan pose-mcp/internal/pose/b07_independent_probe_test.go\n    governed tracked path has no spec provenance claim\n    fix: backfill an explicit claim or add an exact reviewed exclusion\n[!] warning orphan pose-mcp/internal/pose/review_subject_capabilities_test.go\n    governed tracked path has no spec provenance claim\n    fix: backfill an explicit claim or add an exact reviewed exclusion\n[!] warning orphan pose-mcp/internal/pose/docs.go\n    governed tracked path has no spec provenance claim\n    fix: backfill an explicit claim or add an exact reviewed exclusion\n[!] warning orphan .agents/skills/pose-release-closeout/SKILL.md\n    governed tracked path has no spec provenance claim\n    fix: backfill an explicit claim or add an exact reviewed exclusion\n[!] warning orphan pose-mcp/internal/cli/followups.go\n    governed tracked path has no spec provenance claim\n    fix: backfill an explicit claim or add an exact reviewed exclusion\n[!] warning orphan pose-mcp/internal/pose/state.go\n    governed tracked path has no spec provenance claim\n    fix: backfill an explicit claim or add an exact reviewed exclusion\n[!] warning orphan pose-mcp/internal/cli/assessment_agnostic_test.go\n    governed tracked path has no spec provenance claim\n    fix: backfill an explicit claim or add an exact reviewed exclusion\n[!] warning orphan pose-mcp/internal/pose/sshsig.go\n    governed tracked path has no spec provenance claim\n    fix: backfill an explicit claim or add an exact reviewed exclusion\n[!] warning orphan pose-mcp/internal/pose/amendment_history_close_test.go\n    governed tracked path has no spec provenance claim\n    fix: backfill an explicit claim or add an exact reviewed exclusion\n[!] warning orphan pose-mcp/internal/cli/stacks_cmd.go\n    governed tracked path has no spec provenance claim\n    fix: backfill an explicit claim or add an exact reviewed exclusion\n[!] warning orphan pose-mcp/internal/cli/amend_flat_test.go\n    governed tracked path has no spec provenance claim\n    fix: backfill an explicit claim or add an exact reviewed exclusion\n[!] warning orphan pose-mcp/internal/cli/artifact_integrity_test.go\n    governed tracked path has no spec provenance claim\n    fix: backfill an explicit claim or add an exact reviewed exclusion\n[!] warning orphan pose-mcp/internal/cli/docs_sync_test.go\n    governed tracked path has no spec provenance claim\n    fix: backfill an explicit claim or add an exact reviewed exclusion\n\n💡 [Contributor Mode ACTIVE] If this failure stems from a POSE engine defect, false-positive, or missing stack rule, stage a synthetic reproduction locally with:\n   pose contribute stage --type bug --title \"<brief-summary>\"\n","exit_code":1,"status":"failed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_60","type":"agent_message","text":"The targeted policy tests passed in the domain, CLI, and MCP packages, including the prior-round regression tests. I found one advisory gap in doctor: it creates an unbound store, so an open aggregate with a valid remote member can report that no resolver is available even when project bindings exist. Close still uses the bound resolver and enforces the gate.\n"}}
